{"id":45139,"brand_id":228,"unique_id":"Dh5jdh5abGhuLYaD","content_key":"/p/prizes","identifies_id":228,"identifies_type":"Brand","title":"Give Miami Day Prizes","data":{"blocks":[{"col_1":[{"type":"text","uuid":"2dede5f8-217e-4c4d-b8dd-1250a29b887e","content":"\u003ch1\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGive Miami Day 2026 Prizes\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h1\u003e"}],"layout":"block_1","col_order":["col_1"],"spacer_top":{"max":128,"min":0,"val":64},"backgrounds":[{"url":"https://imagecdn.mightycause.com/8cb2c6a8-787e-4825-b5e6-9acc0de75d8a/-/crop/3840x1697/0,25/-/preview/","uuid":"8cb2c6a8-787e-4825-b5e6-9acc0de75d8a"}],"spacer_bottom":{"max":128,"min":0,"val":64},"spacer_mobile":true,"background_type":"image","background_color":"#000000","background_solid":null,"background_opacity":0.03},{"col_1":[{"max":128,"min":16,"val":32,"type":"spacer","uuid":"4ea7c527-343e-49f6-b8a3-e21f93dc0c0d"},{"type":"text","uuid":"870b8d68-2571-441d-bf23-ad84c52d34f5","content":"\u003cp\u003eEveryone loves a little friendly competition, especially when it means more dollars for Miami\u0026rsquo;s nonprofits.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp data-pasted=\"true\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNonprofits:\u003c/strong\u003e Look through the prizes below and pick the ones that fit your goals. Some reward early gifts, some reward the most donors, and others reward gifts at a certain time. Choose your targets, then let your supporters know exactly how and when to give so you can bring home the prize.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDonors:\u003c/strong\u003e Ask the nonprofit you love which prize they\u0026rsquo;re going after. Then give in the way that helps them win it, whether that means giving early, giving at a set time, sharing their posts, or bringing a friend to give too. Your gift does double duty when it helps unlock bonus dollars.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHave fun with the friendly competition, and if you win a prize, tag @themiamifoundation so we can celebrate with you!\u003c/p\u003e"}],"col_2":[{"url":"https://imagecdn.mightycause.com/4131055a-84b4-42c6-8e88-aabb9e824022/","type":"image","uuid":"4131055a-84b4-42c6-8e88-aabb9e824022","scale":"scale-50","width":1000,"height":1000,"content":"prizes.png","new_tab":false,"alt_text":null,"link_url":null,"position":"center"}],"layout":"block_3","col_order":["col_1","col_2"],"spacer_top":{"max":128,"min":0,"val":32},"backgrounds":[],"spacer_bottom":{"max":128,"min":0,"val":32},"spacer_mobile":true,"background_type":"color","background_color":null,"background_solid":null,"background_opacity":0},{"col_1":[{"type":"text","uuid":"0b058c5c-5d2c-48e5-a31c-20cf065084aa","content":"\u003ch2 style=\"text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(106, 62, 189);\"\u003e2026 Prize Opportunities 🏆\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e"}],"layout":"block_2","col_order":["col_1"],"spacer_top":{"max":128,"min":0,"val":32},"backgrounds":[],"spacer_bottom":{"max":128,"min":0,"val":32},"spacer_mobile":true,"background_type":"color","background_color":"#ffffff","background_solid":"#ffffff","background_opacity":0.58},{"col_1":[{"url":"https://imagecdn.mightycause.com/d6545f6d-c958-4c63-a118-4d48a1370d60/-/crop/919x891/39,54/-/preview/","type":"image","uuid":"d6545f6d-c958-4c63-a118-4d48a1370d60","scale":"scale-75","width":919,"height":891,"content":"westrock smurfit logo.png","new_tab":false,"alt_text":null,"link_url":null,"position":"center"},{"max":128,"min":16,"val":16,"type":"spacer","uuid":"0120fed1-8ca6-4048-9a87-cb6a16fc697c"},{"type":"text","uuid":"b1fc916a-2903-41f0-9f9e-a33b8572a6c4","content":"\u003ch2\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThe Million Dollar Match 🤩\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e"}],"col_2":[{"type":"text","uuid":"c6e04224-1784-44d4-8872-9592e5267212","content":"\u003cp id=\"isPasted\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"\u003eA generous anonymous donor is\u003cstrong\u003e\u0026nbsp;matching the first $25 of every unique individual gift\u003c/strong\u003e received, up to a total of $1,000 for each nonprofit. If a donor gives to the same organization twice, their gift will be matched once.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch4\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThis match:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAutomatically applies to all participating nonprofits\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAdds a $25 bonus to every unique individual gift received by an organization, \u003cem\u003elimit 1 match bonus per unique donor\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUp to $1,000 total bonus per nonprofit (40 donations of at least $25).\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e"}],"layout":"block_6","col_order":["col_1","col_2"],"spacer_top":{"max":128,"min":0,"val":64},"backgrounds":[],"spacer_bottom":{"max":128,"min":0,"val":64},"spacer_mobile":true,"background_type":"color","background_color":null,"background_solid":"#6a3ebd","background_opacity":0},{"col_1":[{"url":"https://imagecdn.mightycause.com/64c84ef0-4707-4498-b184-d41aae1907e2/","type":"image","uuid":"64c84ef0-4707-4498-b184-d41aae1907e2","scale":"scale-50","width":1000,"height":1000,"content":"westrock smurfit logo.png","new_tab":false,"alt_text":null,"link_url":null,"position":"center"},{"max":128,"min":16,"val":16,"type":"spacer","uuid":"4fd7aa7e-d2f2-43e1-8cc0-9477d18d186e"},{"type":"text","uuid":"dbecfe5e-a6be-4e61-b737-b68516